{"title": "Menacing Attack (Ranged)", "pageid": 1483, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Menacing_Attack_(Ranged)", "categories": ["Weapon actions", "Wisdom saving throws", "Actions which use weapon action DC", "Actions", "Combat manoeuvres"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div role=\"note\" class=\"hatnote noexcerpt\">This article is about the ranged version of the attack. For the melee version, see <a href=\"/wiki/Menacing_Attack_(Melee)\" title=\"Menacing Attack (Melee)\">Menacing Attack (Melee)</a>. For the version granted by the Bonespike Helmet, see <a href=\"/wiki/Menacing_Attack_(Bonespike_Helmet)\" title=\"Menacing Attack (Bonespike Helmet)\">Menacing Attack (Bonespike Helmet)</a>.  </div>\n\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Menacing_Attack_Ranged.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/49/Menacing_Attack_Ranged.webp/300px-Menacing_Attack_Ranged.webp, /w/images/4/49/Menacing_Attack_Ranged.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/49/Menacing_Attack_Ranged.webp/300px-Menacing_Attack_Ranged.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/49/Menacing_Attack_Ranged.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure><b>Menacing Attack (Ranged)</b> is a <a href=\"/wiki/Battle_Master\" title=\"Battle Master\">Battle Master</a> weapon action. This combat manoeuvre allows the fighter to possibly frighten a target with a ranged weapon attack.\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\nPossibly <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Frightened_(Condition)\" title=\"Frightened (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/75/Frightened_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Frightened_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/75/Frightened_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Frightened_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/75/Frightened_Condition_Icon.webp/40px-Frightened_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Frightens\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/75/Frightened_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Frightened_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/75/Frightened_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Frightened_(Condition)\" title=\"Frightened (Condition)\">Frightens</a> your target. They'll have <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Disadvantage\" title=\"Disadvantage\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/27px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/41px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/55px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Disadvantage\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/27px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"27\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Disadvantage\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Disadvantage\">Disadvantage</a> on <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/13/D20.png/20px-D20.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/13/D20.png/30px-D20.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/13/D20.png/40px-D20.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Ability Check\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/13/D20.png/20px-D20.png.webp\"